  "text": {
    "markdown": "## Monthly revenue, 2024\n\n**Best month: December, $80k.** **Worst month: February, $38k.** Revenue almost doubled across the year, from $42k in January to $80k in December (+90%).\n\n```\nJan  42 █████████████████\nFeb  38 ███████████████            ← worst\nMar  51 ████████████████████\nApr  47 ███████████████████\nMay  55 ██████████████████████\nJun  61 ████████████████████████\nJul  58 ███████████████████████\nAug  49 ████████████████████\nSep  63 █████████████████████████\nOct  67 ███████████████████████████\nNov  72 █████████████████████████████\nDec  80 ████████████████████████████████  ← best\n        each █ = $2.5k\n```\n\n| Month | Revenue | Change vs previous month |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Jan | $42k | — |\n| Feb | $38k | −$4k |\n| Mar | $51k | +$13k |\n| Apr | $47k | −$4k |\n| May | $55k | +$8k |\n| Jun | $61k | +$6k |\n| Jul | $58k | −$3k |\n| Aug | $49k | −$9k |\n| Sep | $63k | +$14k |\n| Oct | $67k | +$4k |\n| Nov | $72k | +$5k |\n| Dec | $80k | +$8k |\n\n### What stands out\n\n- **Total for the year: $683k**, an average of about **$56.9k** a month.\n- **The second half was much stronger:** $389k in July–December against $294k in January–June, 32% more.\n- **Four months fell:** February (−$4k), April (−$4k), July (−$3k) and, most sharply, August (−$9k). The February and August dips were each followed by one of the two biggest jumps of the year: +$13k in March and +$14k in September.\n- **Strong finish:** four straight months of growth from September, with every month from September onward above the yearly average.\n- **By quarter:** Q1 $131k, Q2 $163k, Q3 $170k, Q4 $219k. Q4 alone brought in 32% of the year's revenue.\n",
    "validation": {
